# Book REST API

A simple, educational REST API for managing books built with **Node.js** and **Express.js**. This project demonstrates core REST API concepts including CRUD operations, filtering, error handling, and proper HTTP status codes.

## Features

- ✅ **GET /books** — List all books with optional filtering by author, genre, and year range
- ✅ **GET /books/:id** — Get a single book by ID
- ✅ **POST /books** — Create a new book
- ✅ **PUT /books/:id** — Fully update an existing book
- ✅ **DELETE /books/:id** — Delete a book by ID
- ✅ **GET /books/stats** — Return collection statistics
- ✅ Custom error classes (`NotFoundError`, `ValidationError`)
- ✅ Centralized error-handling middleware
- ✅ Request logging middleware
- ✅ Comprehensive JSDoc documentation

