|---------|---------------|
| Resource naming | Plural nouns (`/books`) |
| HTTP methods | GET (read), POST (create), PUT (update), DELETE (delete) |
| Status codes | 200 OK, 201 Created, 204 No Content, 400 Bad Request, 404 Not Found, 500 Internal Error |
