 *   2. Flexibility — same app can run on different ports or in test environments.
 *   3. Clarity — middleware setup is distinct from network binding.
 *
 * MIDDLEWARE CHAIN (order matters!):
 *   1. requestLogger → logs every incoming request
 *   2. express.json() → parses JSON request bodies
 *   3. jsonParseErrorHandler → catches malformed JSON errors
 *   4. Book routes → handle /books endpoints
 *   5. Stats routes → handle /stats endpoint
 *   6. errorHandler → catches ALL unhandled errors
