## Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| In-memory array storage | Simple, no dependencies; clearly shows where a DB would plug in |
| Custom error classes | Typed errors enable different HTTP codes and consistent responses |
| Async/await on all handlers | Cleaner than `.then()` chains; works with Express's error bubbling |
| Separate route modules | Each module has one responsibility; easy to test in isolation |
| PUT + PATCH support | Real APIs need both full-replace and partial-update semantics |
| Graceful shutdown | Prevents data loss during deployments or process kills |

